  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to assist Member States in implementing UNESCO&apos;s Recommendation on the Ethics of Artificial Intelligence. It will provide support for Member States to strengthen their institutional capacity addressing ethical design, development, use and deployment of AI based on evidence generated through the piloting of the Readiness Assessment, the Ethical Impact Assessments, and other analytical tools.</narrative>
